  Apply proposed changes?

  Description: The model wants to apply changes
  Destination: /tmp/project/README.md

› 1. Apply changes (y)                       Applies only these proposed
                                         changes.
  2. Allow these paths for this session (a)  Allows changes to these paths for
                                         this session.
  3. Tell Codex what to do instead (esc)       Keeps these proposed changes
                                         from being applied.

  enter select · esc cancel
